1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,184
Your head is older than
your feet.

2
00:00:02,434 --> 00:00:04,251
Every second you're
standing,

3
00:00:04,251 --> 00:00:06,381
it pulls a tiny bit
further ahead.

4
00:00:06,631 --> 00:00:07,714
Here's the thing.

5
00:00:07,714 --> 00:00:09,815
Gravity doesn't just
pull on you.

6
00:00:09,815 --> 00:00:11,025
It slows down time.

7
00:00:11,275 --> 00:00:12,950
The closer you are to
Earth,

8
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,625
the slower your clock
ticks.

9
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:16,186
Your feet are closer.

10
00:00:16,186 --> 00:00:17,435
Your head is higher.

11
00:00:17,435 --> 00:00:19,995
So your head's time runs
a little faster.

12
00:00:20,245 --> 00:00:21,591
Sounds made up.

13
00:00:21,591 --> 00:00:22,578
So in 2010,

14
00:00:22,578 --> 00:00:26,794
physicists at a U.S. lab
called NIST tested it.

15
00:00:27,044 --> 00:00:27,930
They took two

16
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,839
super-precise atomic
clocks,

17
00:00:29,839 --> 00:00:31,953
and raised one by about
a foot.

18
00:00:31,953 --> 00:00:33,657
Two steps up a
staircase.

19
00:00:33,907 --> 00:00:35,891
The higher clock ticked
faster.

20
00:00:36,141 --> 00:00:38,485
Over a whole
seventy-nine year life,

21
00:00:38,485 --> 00:00:40,503
those two steps add up
to about

22
00:00:40,503 --> 00:00:42,456
ninety billionths of a
second.

23
00:00:42,706 --> 00:00:44,417
Far too small to feel.

24
00:00:44,417 --> 00:00:45,117
But real.

25
00:00:45,367 --> 00:00:47,190
And your phone feels it.

26
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:49,014
GPS satellites fly high,

27
00:00:49,014 --> 00:00:50,913
so their clocks run
fast.

28
00:00:51,163 --> 00:00:53,943
So engineers set them
slower on the ground,

29
00:00:53,943 --> 00:00:54,848
before launch.

30
00:00:54,848 --> 00:00:57,563
Without that fix, your
map would be wrong.

31
00:00:57,813 --> 00:00:58,577
The verdict?

32
00:00:58,577 --> 00:00:58,895
True.

33
00:00:58,895 --> 00:01:01,824
The higher you are, the
faster your time runs.

34
00:01:02,874 --> 00:01:05,036
So next time you take
the stairs,

35
00:01:05,036 --> 00:01:07,002
you just aged a little
faster.

36
00:01:07,002 --> 00:01:07,461
Barely.

37
00:01:07,711 --> 00:01:09,474
Which means your head
really

38
00:01:09,474 --> 00:01:10,985
is older than your feet.

39
00:01:10,985 --> 00:01:11,615
By a hair.

